      "content": "The Swarmia API provides programmatic access to engineering-effectiveness analytics. It exposes machine-readable built-in reports (code metrics, DORA metrics, AI adoption), custom reports, deployment and AI-usage ingestion, team and membership management, and time-off records. All endpoints are authenticated with a Bearer API token provisioned in the Swarmia application under Settings / API tokens.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Swarmia Support\n Email: hello@swarmia.com",
